irst  because he's so damn good and  um i wanted to be on the same level with  him after breaking her ribs while  training for the movie barry initially  kept working not wanting to be taken off  the film at her role recast but she was  grateful to director chad sahelsky for  instead waiting for her injuries to heal  before he resumed filming barry for her  part described the injury she sustained  as a badge of honor it turns out barry  had the opportunity to work with reeves  many years prior to john wick 3 but  passed on the role in a video interview  with mtv news halle berry revealed that  she was once offered a role in speed a  90s thriller starring reeves and sandra  bullock when asked why she didn't sign  on to that film barry self-deprecatingly  explained  yes my stupidity didn't allow no stop  however reeves was quick to defend  barry's decision not to join the cast of  speed after all the script that berry  red didn't yet feature reeves as its  lead and bizarrely the bus didn't even  leave the parking lot with that premise  reeves said he doesn't blame her for  turning down the roll  right we can't leave this parking lot if  we leave this parking lot on the bus it  blows up i mean  of course i don't blame you for like  going  next  by the time she was offered her role in  john wick 3 however reeves was of course  already attached to the project  in fact he was one of the reasons she  accepted barry was already a fan of the  first two john wick films and had  watched some of the videos of reeves  training for his action scenes in those  films i'd seen behind the scenes you  know clips of him and i saw his training  and i heard about it so i knew what i  was signing up for and that's largely  why i wanted to do it but far from barry  being the only fan of her co-stars work  admiration between the two actors is  mutual during a press conference for  john wick 3 barry mentioned that she  just wanted to prove herself worthy of  sharing a room with reeves but reeves  quickly replied oh come on hallie you're  an inspiration while john wick 3 remains  the sole collaboration between the two  of them judging by their mutual respect  for one another more films starring  barry and reeves together very well  could be on the way  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stuff are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you
 

